   "install": {
    "title": "Getting Started & Join Our Community",
    "html": "<p>We are a group of e/acc design-engineers, hoping to provide modern design components and tools for AIGC.</p>\n<p>Whether for users or professional developers, LobeHub will be your AI Agent playground. Please be aware that LobeHub is currently under active development, and feedback is welcome for any <a href=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/lobehub/lobehub.svg?style=flat\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">issues</a> encountered.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\"></th>\n<th align=\"left\">We are live on Product Hunt! We are thrilled to bring LobeHub to the world. If you believe in a future where humans and agents co-evolve, please support our journey.</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/AYFPHvv2jT\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1127171173982154893?color=5865F2&amp;label=discord&amp;labelColor=black&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></a></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Join our Discord community! This is where you can connect with developers and other enthusiastic users of LobeHub.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>[!IMPORTANT]</p>\n<p><strong>Star Us</strong>, You will receive all release notifications from GitHub without any delay ~ ⭐️</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lobehub/lobehub/stargazers\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://hub-apac-1.lobeobjects.space/blog/assets/893e882a8231960b5a729d691b8a40b3.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></a></p>\n<details>\n  <summary><kbd>Star History</kbd></summary>\n  \n    \n    <img src=\"https://api.star-history.com/svg?repos=lobehub%2Flobehub&amp;type=Date\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100%\" />\n  \n</details>",
    "truncated": false,
    "chars": 1844
   },
   "usage": null,
   "features": {
    "title": "Features",
    "html": "<div><h5>From new hire to one of the team</h5>\n<p>See what Lobe AI gets done, from its first day in your team chat onward.</p>\n<p><sub>WHAT MAKES A SUPER-AGENT</sub></p>\n</div><table>\n  <tr>\n    <td>\n      <b>🔌 Flexible access</b><br />\n      Plug in any IM app, agent or model, all in one place.\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <b>⚡ Parallel work</b><br />\n      Runs several tasks at once, so you don't have to chase each one.\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>\n      <b>🙋 Finds its own work</b><br />\n      Takes on the tasks that suit it, without someone passing messages along.\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <b>📈 Gets more expert</b><br />\n      The more you use it, the faster an agent builds up its expertise.\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table><h5><code>Day 1</code> Welcome to the team</h5>\n<p>You add it to your team chat and ask it to read up. By lunch it has gone through the history and said hello to everyone.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://hub-apac-1.lobeobjects.space/blog/assets/ed6fc1ef1e21e4add545c1e83c32fcb4.webp\" alt=\"Before it starts, it reads up\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://hub-apac-1.lobeobjects.space/blog/assets/a1c721a3cbe9cb8ec0f515217322b514.webp\" alt=\"Lobe AI's IM Bots settings, its team badge and its Day 1 checklist\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></p>\n<div><p><a href=\"https://github.com/lobehub/lobehub#readme-top\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-BACK_TO_TOP-151515?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></a></p>\n</div><h5><code>Week 1</code> Its first task</h5>\n<p>Someone posts a feature request in Discord and nobody assigns it. Lobe AI takes it on, and you only step in once, to accept the result.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://hub-apac-1.lobeobjects.space/blog/assets/b0c761a9084a5958d4205e5d056fa3ae.webp\" alt=\"Picks it up: nobody tags it, and it takes the request anyway\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://hub-apac-1.lobeobjects.space/blog/assets/b8635a2bf3b600697068d70690a62438.webp\" alt=\"Hands it in: you check the evidence, accept, and the PR merges\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://hub-apac-1.lobeobjects.space/blog/assets/3e187a7e1fd004238163b58e20c59817.webp\" alt=\"Reports back: it replies in the original thread\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></p>\n<div><p><a href=\"https://github.com/lobehub/lobehub#readme-top\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-BACK_TO_TOP-151515?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></a></p>\n</div><h5><code>Month 1–2</code> Settling in as the team grows</h5>\n<p>Everyone now has their own agent, and design, releases and docs each have a dedicated one. Lobe AI is still learning when to speak up and when to stay quiet.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://hub-apac-1.lobeobjects.space/blog/assets/c4e5bac0c35f840d9476256996e93e49.webp\" alt=\"One brief every morning\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://hub-apac-1.lobeobjects.space/blog/assets/bc065ed83d1ab0862aea98a7216ff787.webp\" alt=\"It's learning when to speak up\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></p>\n<div><p><a href=\"https://github.com/lobehub/lobehub#readme-top\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-BACK_TO_TOP-151515?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></a></p>\n</div><h5><code>Month 3</code> It passes its review</h5>\n<p>When it started, it got about half of these right. Now it rarely misses, and every correction you gave it has become a lesson it keeps.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://hub-apac-1.lobeobjects.space/blog/assets/82c6818a9dc6fa27cf5aea75a092b448.webp\" alt=\"What it has learned\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></p>\n<div><p><a href=\"https://github.com/lobehub/lobehub#readme-top\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-BACK_TO_TOP-151515?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></a></p>\n</div><div><h5>Bring them onto your team</h5>\n<p>Start with one, and add more when you need them.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://app.lobehub.com\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Try LobeHub Cloud</strong></a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/lobehub/lobehub#-self-hosting\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Self-host it</strong></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ff924737-7d3f-410e-a310-d1f44291e7c7\" alt=\"enterprise\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></p>\n<p>Contact: <a href=\"mailto:business@lobehub.com\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">business@lobehub.com</a></p>\n</div><div><p><a href=\"https://github.com/lobehub/lobehub#readme-top\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-BACK_TO_TOP-151515?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></a></p>\n</div>",
